WEBVTT

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.610
<i>From my room,</i>

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.870
<i>I can see the neighbor's backyard.</i>

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.980
<i>It doesn't get a lot of sunlight...</i>

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:31.280
<i>Rina-chan from next door is 
a few years younger than I am,</i>

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.180
<i>but apparently she's been sick all her life</i>

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:34.820
<i>and never leaves the house.</i>

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.260
The bugs! The bugs!

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:45.000
Mom, do something about them!

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.990
Rina, quiet down.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:47.180
There are no bugs!

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:47.820
See?

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:48.800
They're coming!

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.320
I see them! They're everywhere!

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.010
<i>She must really hate bugs...</i>

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.490
Cold...

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:57.320
So cold.

00:02:57.320 --> 00:02:58.570
How's Grandpa doing?

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.740
He'll be going to Heaven soon.

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:05.200
Yuuji!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.150
You can't go in there!

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.040
He has passed on.

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:22.990
Rina! What are you doing over there?

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.710
Come inside!

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:27.220
Well, that's weird as hell.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.050
Don't tell anyone about this, Hideo.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:33.190
You really think there's a disease
that causes holes all over your body?

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:36.900
I know that I saw my grandpa
with holes all over him.

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:41.070
But when I ask my family about it, 
they say I just dreamed it up...

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.110
They just dismiss it.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.180
I can't blame them.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.210
How do you explain Rina-chan, then?

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.570
It's not like you saw her up close, right?

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:54.040
I think I'm gonna get combo B.
It looks the most filling!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.770
Hello there!

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:58.450
Oh, Hideo-kun, it's been so long!

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:00.850
Yuuji, Hideo-kun's here.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:01.950
Hey!

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.030
Come on in.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:04.610
Don't mind if I do.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:09.870
I mentioned what you said about
that Rina girl to my mom.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:10.880
What?

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:12.320
When I told you not to?

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:13.470
Look, just listen.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:16.500
My mom knew about her.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.630
She used to be a nurse...

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.240
She was there when Rina was born.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:25.850
Apparently she didn't cry at all,

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.690
and she wouldn't breathe,
no matter what they did.

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.930
Which means she should have died, right?

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.410
But she survived, somehow.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:34.690
Not only that,

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:39.000
but after a few days, holes started
opening up all over her body...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.470
From what Mom said,

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:43.300
apparently she was breathing
through those holes.

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:47.250
Then again, my Mom does like to mess around,

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:50.290
so the whole story could've just
been her idea of a bad joke.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.930
Man, you've got some old books here.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.390
They were my grandpa's.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.390
This used to be his room.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.280
Huh? There's a diary...

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.370
Is this yours?

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.840
I wouldn't start a diary.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:09.140
Must be your grandpa's, then.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.410
Wanna read it?

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:12.290
That's kinda...

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:16.100
We might find out why he died.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:22.140
Huh?

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:23.300
What's this drawing?

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:27.050
"I got my hands on something odd today."

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:30.200
<i>A deep green jade carving.</i>

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:33.410
<i>September 13th.</i>

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:36.210
<i>I spent the day gazing at the jade.</i>

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:40.440
<b>Nakamachi Hospital</b>

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.650
<i>September 23rd.</i>

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.440
<i>I can't stop shivering...</i>

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.120
<i>I feel so cold.</i>

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:47.160
<i>I wonder what these things I see 
popping up all over my skin are...</i>

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.700
<i>September 25th.</i>

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.980
<i>In the afternoon,</i>

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:54.870
<i>some doctor that no one called for 
came by to give me an injection.</i>

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:57.170
<i>September 27th.</i>

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.410
<i>I can't believe it,</i>

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:00.630
<i>but holes have opened up all over my body.</i>

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:04.880
<i>I can feel the air entering
me through these holes.</i>

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.590
<i>September 29th.</i>

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.540
<i>A swarm of insects has
come in through the window!</i>

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:12.810
<i>They look just like the carving!</i>

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:17.800
<i>They entered my body through
the holes on my back...</i>

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:22.040
<i>I can feel them crawling inside me!</i>

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.500
<i>October 2nd.</i>

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:28.360
<i>My strength is fading,
and there are more holes now.</i>

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:29.680
<i>It's a curse...</i>

00:06:29.680 --> 00:06:31.700
<i>The jade has cursed me.</i>

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.210
<i>Anyone who holds it will be cursed!</i>

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:38.500
<i>I used what strength I had left to 
toss the carving out the window.</i>

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:46.410
The handwriting gets too 
messy to read beyond that.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.550
I was right after all!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:53.430
Rina-chan next door is being
affected by the jade's curse now!

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:55.810
Seriously, though?

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.620
It's hard to believe.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:02.610
Is that her?

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.380
That's her usual doctor...

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:36.490
<i>Is the mysterious doctor the diary mentions</i>

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.100
<i>the one who was with Grandpa when he died?</i>

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:44.520
<i>I get the feeling... they look alike.</i>

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.230
He has passed on.

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:53.410
<i>If he's Rina-chan's doctor...</i>

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:58.130
<i>And if the jade carving is next door,</i>

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:00.070
<i>and he's looking for it...</i>

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:03.050
<i>Maybe I should tell them about this,</i>

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:04.540
<i>for Rina-chan's sake.</i>

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:26.110
<i>Typhoon 21 remains large and powerful,</i>

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:29.610
<i>and is moving along the Kii peninsula,
headed north-by-northeast...</i>

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:47.980
Who are you?!

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:49.250
Yuuji!

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:50.500
It's me...

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.630
Hideo!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.300
I'm so cold!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.470
What the?!

00:08:58.210 --> 00:08:59.480
Look at this.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:02.210
That's the jade carving!

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:03.840
I picked it up,

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:05.780
the day we read the diary.

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:08.640
It was where the girl pointed!

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:11.010
I didn't think the curse was real.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.380
I thought the jade would be valuable.

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.860
This damn rock bewitched me!

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.820
But the curse is real.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.330
Holes started opening up all over my body...

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.290
And then he appeared.

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.220
He's the curse's servant.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:26.620
He goes wherever the jade does.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:28.860
He's here!

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.000
He's come for me!

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:35.920
Hideo!

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:46.190
<i>The next day,</i>

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:51.620
<i>Hideo's body was found
on the edge of the river.</i>

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.800
<i>I don't know what happened to the jade.</i>

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:57.610
<i>And...</i>

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:11.000
Collection No. 034

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:11.000
<b>Shiver</b>

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:16.590
<i>I was born to a poor family
of traveling entertainers.</i>

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.900
<i>Our father was the head of the troupe,</i>

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.810
<i>and we kids were all members.</i>

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:24.100
<i>For as long as I can remember,
I've been traveling.</i>

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:28.480
Let me introduce you all 
to your new classmate...

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:32.500
This is Kitawaki Haruhiko-kun,
who's joining us in Class 5-3.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:37.270
His family travels all over Japan
performing puppet shows.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:38.840
It won't be for long,

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:41.390
but I hope you can all get along.

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:42.400
Nice to meet you.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.830
Haruhiko-kun!

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.130
My name's Hidaka Kinuko. Nice to meet you.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.710
Where's your house?

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.880
It's a truck.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.490
It's in the park, off to the side.

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:58.090
Wow, you live in a truck?

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.000
Hey, can I come over?

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:01.990
Sure.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:05.170
Wow!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.710
Look at all the dolls!

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:09.520
Huh?

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:10.800
What's this one?

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:13.770
Oh, that's Jean-Pierre.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:15.550
He's a magician puppet.

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.320
He's my brother's favorite.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.810
Your brother's got kinda creepy taste, huh?

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:23.150
Just kidding!

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:25.240
There are more over here, too...

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:26.830
Look!

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:31.640
I'm sorry!

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.010
Did I scare you?

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:34.480
Ugh...

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.970
Kitawaki Marionette Show

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:39.970
<i>Regardless of how close I got to anybody,</i>

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:42.910
<i>once our shows in that town were finished,</i>

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:45.800
<i>we had to move on to the next one.</i>

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.800
Haruhiko-kun!

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:50.800
Let's meet again someday, okay?!

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:55.510
This life is kinda depressing
when you think about it, y'know?

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:58.050
Day after day, we make
puppets move around,

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.610
going from one town to another...

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.190
No chance to make friends.

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:05.080
I wish we could just settle down somewhere.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.380
Maybe if Dad got sick or something,

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:09.550
we wouldn't have to put up with it anymore...

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:10.580
I'm just kidding.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.650
<i>Ironically,</i>

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:14.750
<i>my brother's wish came true.</i>

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.260
<i>Dad collapsed while working,
not long after that.</i>

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:24.220
Puppeteering is about using your
puppets to express yourself.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:27.530
The movements and expressions of the puppets

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:30.230
are extensions of the puppeteer's feelings.

00:12:30.230 --> 00:12:33.490
The puppets themselves are
no more than a tool to that end.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:37.730
Whether they live or die depends
on the one who's in control.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:41.540
They do whatever we tell them to, after all.

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:46.440
Hey, Haruhiko, what do you think?

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:47.320
About what?

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:50.560
Do you think people are 
in control of puppets?

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:52.040
Of course they are.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:54.220
I don't agree.

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:57.110
See, we're being forced
to move by the puppets.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:01.620
Dad wants to keep doing puppet shows, 
despite making next to no money from it,

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.800
because the puppets control him.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.510
Well, I'm not gonna let them put me to work!

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:11.000
<i>The next morning, my brother</i>

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.130
<i>ran away from home.</i>

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:14.990
<i>And six months later,</i>

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.730
<i>our father passed away.</i>

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:21.730
Collection No. 060

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:21.730
<b>House of Puppets</b>

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:25.130
Hey, Onii-chan.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.780
After I graduate, I'll get a job, too.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:30.490
I feel bad about you having to work 
at that factory for both of us.

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:33.170
Don't be dumb. You still have 
to finish middle school.

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:35.260
Hey, excuse me...

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:37.780
If I've got the wrong person, I'm sorry,

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:40.500
but aren't you Kitawaki Haruhiko-san?

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:43.480
Yes, and you are...?

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:45.160
I knew it!

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.820
Do you remember me?

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:48.020
I'm Hidaka Kinuko.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:50.510
We were in fifth grade together!

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:53.810
Oh, I do remember you!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.100
What are you doing in this town?

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.940
I got a job and moved here.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:14:01.210
I had a feeling we might meet again.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:04.700
It's almost like God brought us back together!

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:11.530
Hey.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.880
Here you go.

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:14.460
It was in your mailbox.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:15.270
Thanks.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:16.860
Who's it from?

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.620
It's from my brother...

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:24.670
He lives here, too?

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:27.490
And he had his own house built?

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:31.640
Yukihiko-niichan's house
is closer than I expected.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.400
This is it...

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.350
<i>Yes, who is it?</i>

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.650
My name is Kitawaki Haruhiko.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.080
<i>Oh, I'm glad you're here!</i>

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.970
Jean-Pierre?

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:04.820
Bro!

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:06.430
Hey, bro!

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:08.730
Is that you up there?!

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:11.560
It's good to see you, Haruhiko, Natsumi.

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:12.580
We've been waiting.

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:15.890
Welcome.

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:18.100
It's been a while. I've missed you two.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.650
Let me introduce my wife, Sumire.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.910
It's so nice to meet you.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:24.830
This is my son, Ayao.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.100
He's three years old.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.340
He's asleep at the moment, though.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:31.360
Now, why don't you two come in?

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:37.400
It goes to show that life will 
always work out somehow.

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:40.990
All I had when I left home was a
little bit of money and Jean-Pierre.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.700
It took a lot of work,

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.510
but he brought me good luck.

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:49.020
And because of that, I now run my 
own small business in my twenties.

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:49.880
Now...

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:52.240
Don't be shy. Eat as much as you want!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.230
You there, could you put some music on?

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:56.510
Of course, sir.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:10.530
I had these life-sized ballerina
puppets made for today.

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.530
Oh, even Ayao's dancing now.

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.090
Dancing in his sleep, of all things.

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.700
<i>Natsumi and I</i>

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:22.910
<i>started visiting our brother's
house regularly after that.</i>

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.090
Come and get me, Aya-chan!

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:26.930
I'm right over here!

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:29.380
Ayao has really taken to his Auntie Natsumi.

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:34.300
And the ballerinas seem to 
be rather interested in you.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:36.740
Hey, Yukihiko-niisan,

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.640
I want to do ballet, too!

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:41.860
Can you control me like
your wife and Ayao-chan?

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:43.440
What are you saying, Natsumi?!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:44.850
Oh, it's fine.

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:48.880
Sumire, could you get Natsumi
ready in the other room?

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:49.860
Of course.

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:52.220
Come along, now.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.030
Okay!

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:57.500
Bro, can I ask you something?

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.240
What is it?

00:16:58.510 --> 00:16:59.860
Are you all...

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:01.700
strung up through the ceiling?

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.040
That's right.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:06.160
We're being manipulated with piano wire.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:09.990
So... someone's controlling 
you from the ceiling?

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:12.370
A couple of workers I've hired.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:14.990
Right now there are four or 
five of them handling me.

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:17.960
I had this house built for that very purpose.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.560
Why go to all that trouble?

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:21.140
Why not just move on your own?

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:24.560
Do I look like I'm troubled in any way?

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:28.050
With the exception of my fingers,
my body is completely relaxed right now.

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:32.320
And in spite of that,
I can move however I like.

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.540
The idea may be that the
puppeteer controls the puppet,

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:38.120
but it's the other way around.

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:42.130
The puppet is the one who is truly in control.

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:43.080
Do you understand?

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:45.170
She's ready!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:47.290
Come on in. Let's take a look.

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.460
Well? Isn't she beautiful?

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.520
Yes, it's quite the transformation!

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:54.910
But she's still a little tense...

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:57.310
Try relaxing a bit.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.020
Fantastic!

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:18.150
Natsumi, take the strings off.

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:18.940
We're going home.

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:20.110
Why?

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:22.160
Yes, why the rush?

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.040
You two should relax with us today.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:28.020
I'm sorry, bro, but this weird game 
of yours doesn't sit right with me.

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:29.030
Come on, Natsumi!

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:30.080
No way.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:32.620
If you want to leave,
go ahead and leave on your own.

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:34.990
I'm going to move in here.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.180
Why don't you start living with
Kinuko-san or something?

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:38.800
Don't be stupid!

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:40.340
No, it's fine.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.030
Why don't you move in, too, Haruhiko?

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.790
No, thank you!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:45.940
Haruhiko-san,

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:48.520
you've been avoiding me lately...

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.130
Why?

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:52.700
And where did Natsumi-chan go?

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.050
<i>When it came to my brother,</i>

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:57.220
What happened at your brother's house?

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:56.990
<i>all I could do was avoid the subject.</i>

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.260
And why won't you talk to me?

00:18:57.610 --> 00:19:00.620
<i>I couldn't bring myself
to introduce him to her.</i>

00:19:01.390 --> 00:19:04.610
Natsumi's fitting in here
at the house perfectly.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.980
That's right!

00:19:05.980 --> 00:19:08.620
I'm a first-class ballerina, you know!

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:10.710
What are those?

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:14.670
Let me guess. You want
to string me up, too?

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:17.050
Sorry, but no thanks.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:19.640
I don't intend to join your little party.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:27.160
<i>So he's been meeting with another woman...</i>

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:28.910
Damn it!

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:31.480
He's dead wrong if he thinks
I'm just going to back down!

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.820
Huh, that scared me for a second...

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:45.490
I've seen this puppet before...

00:19:56.690 --> 00:19:58.150
What are you doing?!

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:04.050
Help me, Onii-chan!

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.210
What the hell is happening?!

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:08.850
Bro, make them stop!

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.000
It's no good!

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.890
I can't move like I want!

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:13.980
He's upset!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.510
He must be upset!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:16.880
Jean-Pierre!

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:17.150
Hey!

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.040
People in the ceiling!

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.000
Cut it out!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.320
Stop this!

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:32.000
Jean-Pierre!

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:34.870
Jean-Pierre!

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:53.510
Kinuko...

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:14.590
How...

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:16.060
How did this happen?

00:21:16.060 --> 00:21:18.000
Onii-chan!

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:33.220
Onii-chan, I can't get up...

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:34.320
Help me...

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:35.370
Don't worry!

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:37.220
You'll be back to normal in no time.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:39.690
What about the others?

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:44.590
They're...

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:47.300
puppets?

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:52.950
<i>My brother and his family
had transformed into puppets.</i>

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.560
<i>Could it have happened because</i>

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:58.670
<i>they were being manipulated 
like puppets for so long?</i>

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:01.500
<i>Or maybe they were puppets all along?</i>

00:22:02.100 --> 00:22:03.680
<i>I had no way of knowing.</i>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Collection
